{"game": "space-marine-2011", "language": "english", "appid": 55150, "month": "2016-10", "window": 4, "start_date": 1477267200, "end_date": 1477958399, "month_true_total": 51, "quota": 5, "returned": 4, "pulled_at": "2026-10-09 17:52:57 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "26327989", "author": {"steamid": "76561197972807826", "personaname": "Kettch", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/kettch19/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 5, "playtime_forever": 532, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 532, "last_played": 1477877730, "avatar": "72789abfbdf55ae8e229c9782c871d8a90bb783b"}, "language": "english", "review": "Overall fun game. Very linear but fun just to plow straight forward and mow down hordes of orks. A few of the default controls are awkward to use (F + Mouse 5 for stun, really?). The story is okay, not super in depth but at least continuous and flows. I don't have knowledge of the Warhammer board game to compare that aspect for accuracy but I'd imagine since Games Workshop was directly involved it may be close enough.", "timestamp_created": 1477878069, "timestamp_updated": 1477878069, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1315281600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "26325510", "author": {"steamid": "76561197982295752", "personaname": "Running-Target", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/Running-Target/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 2224, "playtime_forever": 520, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 509, "last_played": 1722520478, "avatar": "eecb34e26ea59067475bc411c73da82162960079"}, "language": "english", "review": "Space Marine is a Great solo WH40K space marine action FPS. You play the leader of a squad of space marines.  Hard even on Easy mode, when playing on keyboard and mouse, while using my gaming keypad helped.   Has a multiplayer mode that is what the DLC is for.  Might play best with a game pad.  Only Xbox 360 gamepad support.\n\nOnly buy this old game on sale or in the big bundle.\n\nfor more info:\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=dOKiJMWYdwE\n\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Ahw_wAYf5tI\n\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=rh-hAC8xugE", "timestamp_created": 1477867076, "timestamp_updated": 1667050125, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 6, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.544596612453460693", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1315281600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "26316923", "author": {"steamid": "76561198286474114", "personaname": "JerryMullins", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198286474114/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 9, "playtime_forever": 26348, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 6475, "last_played": 1728398518, "avatar": "fef49e7fa7e1997310d705b2a6158ff8dc1cdfeb"}, "language": "english", "review": "Over 100 hours logged, bet that's more than any of you have logged on it, right?! \n10/10", "timestamp_created": 1477838067, "timestamp_updated": 1477838067, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1315281600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "26316427", "author": {"steamid": "76561198044634691", "personaname": "Not agaiN", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198044634691/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 17, "playtime_forever": 790, "playt